[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32700300_01_0000","text":"综艺节目工作人员"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32700300_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32700300_01_0010","text":"就是那种，答题答错的人跑过去，\n会弄得满身泥巴的环节。很常见的嘛！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32700300_01_0020","text":"那种感觉的，您觉得怎么样？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32700300_01_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32700300_01_0030","text":"啊—"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32700300_01_0040","text":"我倒是无所谓——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32700300_01_0050","text":"不好意思\n“满身泥巴”这个，有点……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32700300_01_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32700300_01_0060","text":"──！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32700300_01_0070","text":"啊哈哈，果然不行吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32700300_01_0080","text":"非常抱歉……！\n这也关系到铃木的形象，所以……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32700300_01_0090","text":"嘛，对偶像来说确实比较难呢！\n我只是随口说说，您别在意"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32700300_01_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32700300_01_0100","text":"…………"}]
